		)
		(uuid "b2c0b1fb-08a1-56f3-be95-21efb338d1ce")
	)
	(text "VOUT = 0.6 V x (1 + R102 / R103) = 4.98 V.  L101: ripple 0.58 A at 12 V, 0.72 A at 18 V; saturation 7 A is above the 5.1 A current limit.  EN tied to VIN (always on)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 93.98 0)
		(effects
