				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c2e6c60e-378a-52fb-9665-1bc4137115df")
	)
	(text "Q101: drain to the input, source to +12V; body diode conducts first, then the channel. Reversed input: gate = source = 0 V, the FET stays off."
